@attribute [CustomPage("Usage Guide")]

<h2>Usage Guide</h2>
<p>
    This catalog documents the <code>AlertBox</code> component. Alerts are rendered inline and
    do not trap focus, so they are safe to place anywhere in a page.
</p>
<p>
    Pick a severity that matches the message: informational text stays neutral, while a failure
    should always use the error severity so it is announced consistently.
</p>
